{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1000_034ayu", "source_sha256": "38ebec25d6792a810d59c32216a4be14a711a0c4d6f0036a1bf6b467a9373f61", "ja": "今のめちゃくちゃクール……おお～。", "zh": "现在这个超酷的……哦哦～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1001_p", "source_sha256": "77c8bc6a9b06030e847242fcd1250ac96642deb1dd609e819301c2fc895a30ec", "ja": "お疲れ様、歩。\nあれ？　何みてるんだ？", "zh": "辛苦了，步。\n咦？你在看什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1002_034ayu", "source_sha256": "906ac1e2975c59a673525595b76972e39082a642a49afbdff837c8474f9168ab", "ja": "あ、{$P$}。この前アップされた\nダンス動画だよ。兄貴が振り付けしてるんだ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。是前阵子上传的舞蹈视频哦。是我哥编的舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d8f3418d65fc674d5ea8e9018176df199c6cb0fba09c73da1d42bd62b24c1485", "ja": "へえ。歩のお兄さんはたしか、アメリカで\n振付師をしてるんだったな。", "zh": "哦。步的哥哥记得是在美国当编舞师吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1004_034ayu", "source_sha256": "62712e2991982ca7d96d3e700205babbace3516aa6a2e018e469651cd925cd9f", "ja": "そうだよ。真美とアオのこと話してたら、\nなんか思い出しちゃって。", "zh": "没错。和真美聊到小葵的事，不知怎么就想起来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1005_p", "source_sha256": "d185d0cbf646299f41ee46ac2cc894636fc3245a74897b1559a6f0400fe3ae78", "ja": "ああ、バスケで真美と仲良くなった子か。", "zh": "啊，就是那个通过篮球和真美成为朋友的孩子吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "402b032e2657112f9503518ff2d53181de676e224b338d39f7cc41bc6171411f", "ja": "うん。離れ離れになっても、ずっと繋がってるって\n感覚、アタシもわかるからさ。", "zh": "嗯。就算彼此分开了，那种依然紧紧相连的\n感觉，我也很懂呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1007_034ayu", "source_sha256": "60096cf327fb209bcadf6b73fc48559d6dbb3af6ffc81a4f8049de258667fbd3", "ja": "家族は家族だもんね。どんなことになっても\n家族じゃなくなったりしない。", "zh": "毕竟家人就是家人嘛。不管变成什么样，\n也不会就不是家人了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "185dbbf68734c4b89b960b00cc19213d6983757ff1ca671262b670442f7f0af0", "ja": "でも友達はそうじゃないから。離れたら、それっきり\nになったりもするから、怖いんだろうなって。", "zh": "可是朋友就不一样了。因为一旦分开，也可能就此断了联系，所以才会觉得害怕吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1009_p", "source_sha256": "648dbb471a393d82513e24ec60e8d6546b301ea952d8bc613c3dfdabb93e7442", "ja": "そうだな……。まあ、家族だからって\n安心できない場合もあるわけだけど。", "zh": "是啊……不过，就算是家人，也有让人无法安心的时候。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "56869884029d7d9524723c43e81a7361434c839bf7694ecc0eb3655c79fc8e43", "ja": "え？　そうだっけ？", "zh": "诶？是这样的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1011_p", "source_sha256": "7fc6ba9eee81c7e0784b4b1232ec1d56b86986ac6f5f08ae1ff12c6aad9a3e22", "ja": "え？　だから夫婦とかさ。\n結婚したら家族だけど、別れる場合もあるし。", "zh": "诶？所以说夫妻之类的啊。\n结婚后虽然会成为家人，但也有分开的情况。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1012_034ayu", "source_sha256": "76b74a56b6cb885477de22dc1392a552684bb93ed3d7d96e5dc841c04cdd89c0", "ja": "結婚したら家族……。", "zh": "结婚了就是家人……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "cf30d02f76e63c85a6382f7ba78d7ff767ef0a2b90d7563a0b929159808cade4", "ja": "いやいやいやいや！　なんでそんな、恋バナみたいな\n話になるの！？　やめてよ{$P$}！", "zh": "不不不不！怎么会扯到恋爱话题上\n去了啊！？快别说了，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1014_p", "source_sha256": "8a0f13c409537d3b5e404640719217afd7dcb68fe735f45bf6a0fa707db79763", "ja": "こ、恋バナ！？\nそんな話したっけ？　誰が？　いつの間に！？", "zh": "恋、恋爱话题！？\n我们刚才聊过这种话题吗？谁聊的？什么时候聊的！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1015_034ayu", "source_sha256": "5e65470afd6a65b64b88e98f11cacad7147ca27ad0a0e164dfb0bc20b5c3f693", "ja": "だって夫婦の話とか、アタシにはまだ早いって～！\nもー、なんで{$P$}は……ん？", "zh": "因为聊的是夫妻的话题，对我来说还太早了啦～！\n真是的，{$P$}怎么会……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0523_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0523_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b27b95715b766713e4541e3f239740f37b8d5c5791e727451ba059cb56356177", "ja": "つまり……{$P$}は夫婦の話が\n早くないって……コト、だったり！？", "zh": "也就是说……{$P$}觉得聊夫妻的话题还不早……是这个意思！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
